----------------------------------------------------------------------
STATES REPRODUCED (every state renders — no hidden surface)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  loading   -> .redirecting phase: spinner + "Redirecting to Alert Rules…" + breadcrumb
  empty     -> .empty phase: no inbound location -> friendly empty state + "Go to
               Notifications" safe-parent fallback (never a dead end)
  error     -> .error phase: resolve failure -> QueryError-equivalent + Retry affordance
  stale     -> connection == .stale -> amber freshness chip + "Reconnecting" banner +
               one guarded auto-refresh (resets once live)
  offline   -> connection == .offline -> muted chip + "Offline — local route change"
               banner; keeps the resolved target, no refetch
  resolved  -> .resolved phase: success check + "Opening Alert Rules" + breadcrumb +
               manual Continue (re-issues the replace if the host deferred it)
  Accessibility: per-phase VoiceOver summary, isHeader traits, isButton labels,
                 reduce-motion respected via TSMotion + accessibilityReduceMotion.

